     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">A new manuscript, entitled “Two methods for mapping and visualizing associated data on phylogeny using ggtree”, was accepted to be published on MBE. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">As its title indicated, this manuscript introduces two methods for data integration and visualization. You can find the supplemental file on github, <a href=\"https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/plotting_tree_with_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/plotting_tree_with_data&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482436986000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DE2tUgEzUR3cfbR0Rn4jw\">https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/plotting_tree_with_data</a>, which IMO is a good resource for learning ggtree.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Bests,<br>Guangchuang</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdiBkaXI9Imx0ciI+PGRpdj5EZWFyIGFsbCw8L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PkEg\r\nbmV3IG1hbnVzY3JpcHQsIGVudGl0bGVkICJUd28gbWV0aG9kcyBmb3IgbWFwcGluZyBhbmQgdmlz\r\ndWFsaXppbmcgYXNzb2NpYXRlZCBkYXRhIG9uIHBoeWxvZ2VueSB1c2luZyBnZ3RyZWUiLCB3YXMg\r\nYWNjZXB0ZWQgdG8gYmUgcHVibGlzaGVkIG9uIE1CRS4gPGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2\r\nPjxkaXY+QXMgaXRzIHRpdGxlIGluZGljYXRlZCwgdGhpcyBtYW51c2NyaXB0IGludHJvZHVjZXMg\r\ndHdvIG1ldGhvZHMgZm9yIGRhdGEgaW50ZWdyYXRpb24gYW5kIHZpc3VhbGl6YXRpb24uIFlvdSBj\r\nYW4gZmluZCB0aGUgc3VwcGxlbWVudGFsIGZpbGUgb24gZ2l0aHViLCAmbHQ7aHR0cHM6Ly9naXRo\r\ndWIuY29tL0d1YW5nY2h1YW5nWXUvcGxvdHRpbmdfdHJlZV93aXRoX2RhdGEmZ3Q7LCB3aGljaCBJ\r\nTU8gaXMgYSBnb29kIHJlc291cmNlIGZvciBsZWFybmluZyBnZ3RyZWUuPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+\r\nPC9kaXY+PGRpdj5CZXN0cyw8YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5HdWFuZ2NodWFuZzxicj48L2Rpdj48L2Rp\r\ndj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\"></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div 